 "text": "Hey! How are you feeling? Do you want it deductible per episode, or as one big flat sum upfront? Per episode is more common. Some insurances do that, usually for longer shoots. It makes booking easier for everyone. Say it was particularly delicious. No one will object. Ask for a small amount upfront, say a few coffees, and see it in person. If you like each other, full bill will fall into place. You' get a hang of it. Most people are friendly once you' shot with someone else.",
